# kw-set-malformed: Does a set line with an unclosed brace stop the load (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: 5
# pc: ODE0020
# ruling: XPPAUT prints added s doing $ zz and loads, so the unclosed brace is not an error. No output value shows it, and run.sh does not check that message. PhaseCont rejects the line.
x'=0
x(0)=3
par a=5
aux v=a
set s {zz
@ total=0,dt=1
